        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Æthelweard, Cynric\n- Works: a Latin version of a collection of annals\n- Topics: the source of information about Cynric, an old extinct language, the word \"Kine\"\n\nFacts:\n- Æthelweard was an author of a Latin version of a collection of annals.\n- Everything known about Cynric comes from that collection of annals.\n- The collection of annals was written in an old extinct language.\n- The old extinct language included the word \"Kine,\" which means weasel.",
